&lt;p&gt;IkiWiki::Plugin::xslt is an IkiWiki plugin implementing the
&lt;a href=&quot;https://jyi2ya.github.io/plugins/ikiplugins/doc/ikiwiki/directive/xslt.html&quot;&gt;xslt&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://jyi2ya.github.io/plugins/ikiplugins/doc/ikiwiki/directive.html&quot;&gt;directive&lt;/a&gt;
to process an input XML data file with XSLT, and output the result in
the page where the directive was called.&lt;/p&gt;

